<title>GUYANA: CRICKET-INDIA ALL OUT FOR 355 V WEST INDIES - TEA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA ALL OUT FOR 355 V WEST INDIES - TEA.</headline>
<dateline>GEORGETOWN, Guyana 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were bowled out for 355 at tea on the final day of the fifth test against West.Indies on Monday.</p>
</text>
